ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build your own airplane and optimize its performance. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Takeoff, fly and land your plane with physics based controls. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore and discover new biomes, each offering unique challenges and cargo types. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Transport and sell different cargo types. Each cargo type offers its own unique challenge. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get creative in creative mode. Use your infinite resources to build anything you can imagine. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cargo truck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660460/e91015284d51cf5cd827167f580d7ec17ef4d955.jpg"},{"name":"Campaign","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660460/0dbbc0113560fda188551de0d327e545f8b6f96b.jpg"},{"name":"Wood engine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660460/0daf88d0ffa852ef5f58d1eb52287afde04ab76e.jpg"},{"name":"Wingless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660460/2c04384cbde84027ab9ffe9bc2e10f295e13775a.jpg"},{"name":"Two Birds, One Flight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660460/5f378be14935e10821600be827189d0df56ec82f.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660460/53124b33de4d67cea95a0d41d83c9afb415ed8e5.jpg"},{"name":"Airship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660460/30d16445b478de2339098c3b0a07e40d8521c8a9.jpg"},{"name":"Speed 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660460/27f31ab946179d66c1f128633489fadfed17d621.jpg"